type: software
title: "Localization_Towed_Array: Model-based localization of marine mammals from towed array data"
version: 1.3.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23397660
authors:
  - family-names: Gruden
    given-names: Pina
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8756-6514"
    affiliation: "Pina Gruden s.p."
license: BSD-3-Clause-Clear
repository-code: "https://github.com/PinaGruden/Localization_Towed_Array"
abstract: >-
  A MATLAB package for model-based localization of marine mammals from
  towed hydrophone array data. It takes tracked time-differences-of-arrival
  (TDOAs) from the companion package TDOA_tracking_master and estimates
  source positions using ambiguity surfaces and array geometry from GPS
  and sensor-depth data.
keywords:
  - passive acoustic monitoring
  - acoustic localization
  - towed hydrophone array
  - marine mammals
  - MATLAB
